path too.\", \"line\": 20, \"span\": \"it holds on the 503 path too, even though the cause of that refusal is an entirely different one\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The cause of a 503 refusal is an entirely different cause from a 429 refusal.\", \"line\": 20, \"span\": \"even though the cause of that refusal is an entirely different one\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A 200 response wants nothing retried.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"A 200 wants nothing\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A 429 response wants the stated wait.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"a 429 wants the stated wait\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A 500 response may be retried once its wait has passed.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"a 500 may be retried once that wait has passed\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A 503 response is the overload path.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"a 503 is the overload path\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A batch credential is allowed fifty times the default allowance.\", \"line\": 31, \"span\": \"A batch credential is allowed fifty times the default allowance\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A batch credential's allowance is measured over exactly the same window as the default allowance.\", \"line\": 31, \"span\": \"it is measured over exactly the same window\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The tier is set on the credential when it is issued.\", \"line\": 33, \"span\": \"The tier is set on the credential when it is issued\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The tier cannot be asked for per call.\", \"line\": 33, \"span\": \"cannot be asked for per call\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The log line should carry the credential, the window and the wait.\", \"line\": 38, \"span\": \"The log line should carry the credential, the window and the wait\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The gateway refuses a request for three reasons.\", \"line\": 43, \"span\": \"The gateway refuses a request for three reasons\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Only one of the gateway's three refusal reasons is the rate-cap reason.\", \"line\": 43, \"span\": \"and only one of them is the one above\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A credential may be suspended.\", \"line\": 43, \"span\": \"A credential may be suspended\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A route may be closed for maintenance.\", \"line\": 43, \"span\": \"a route may be closed for maintenance\"},\n    {\"text\": \"A body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit and be refused before it has even been read.\", \"line\": 43, \"span\": \"a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit and be refused before it has even been read\"},\n    {\"text\": \"None of the three non-cap refusal reasons clears itself by waiting for a stated number of seconds.\", \"line\": 43, \"span\": \"None of those three clears itself by waiting for a stated number of seconds\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is 0.\", \"line\": 49, \"span\": \"the number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is 0\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Requests for a cap increase reach the platform team through the usual channel.\", \"line\": 51, \"span\": \"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Requests for a cap increase are answered within two working days.\", \"line\": 51, \"span\": \"they are answered within two working days\"},\n    {\"text\": \"There is no expedited path for requesting a cap increase.\", \"line\": 51, \"span\": \"There is no expedited path\"},\n    {\"text\": \"There is no exception list for requesting a cap increase.\", \"line\": 51, \"span\": \"no exception list\"}\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":12564,"type":"result","duration_ms":12642,"uuid":"7dfcb2ec-8bab-4ee6-a49f-1739d3880bf0","ttft_stream_ms":1056,"time_to_request_ms":105,"first_content_frame_ms":1056,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
